{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-mango-ice","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Mango Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eUpon the exhale, Nasty Podmate Salt – Mango Ice will blow your taste buds away with the abundance of juicy sweetness and cooling iced menthol finish. The brilliance of a fleshy ripened mango is often described as a hybrid of menthol.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNasty Podmate Salt – Mango Ice is bursting with frosty fruit brilliance and masterfully blended for all refillable low-wattage devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Mango Ice Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Mango, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558692407,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Mango Ice 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558725175,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Mango Ice 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-mango-ice-salt.jpg?v=1746638888","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-podmate-nic-salt-mango-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




